    "title": "New book explores Muskogee's violent Wild West history - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Erin Conrad ,\n7 hours ago\nMUSKOGEE, Okla. - A new book from local author Art Burton explores the violent frontier history of Muskogee, highlighting the outlaws, lawmen and gunfights that shaped the area during its territorial years. Burton is an expert on Oklahoma’s Bass Reeves and the history of African American and Native American outlaws...\nRead full article\n1",
